
# Welcome to the Osgood Library

Entry to the Demosplash 2025 ASCII art compo. Made by Antero.

## HOW TO VIEW

Option 1 (easiest): Open onepage.html in a web browser and scroll through the
single-page version. You can click the links to jump between scenes.

Option 2 (original): Open index.html in a browser and click the links to
navigate the different areas until you reach the end page. Try to view all the
scenes, including the plaque at the base of the statue in the foyer, and the
desk in the archives.

Option 3: Open onepage.txt and scroll through the plain text version.

